;Fragrance ("CHARACTER wears a pleasant fragrance...")
;いい匂い
;==================================================
;==================================================
;Optional: Determines if the standard description should be skipped.
;Return 0 if description and KOJO should be shown, 1 if description should be hidden and KOJO shown, 2 if description should be shown and KOJO hidden, and 3 if both description and KOJO should be hidden.
;==================================================

@M_KOJO_EGG_MESSAGE_COUNTER_MESSAGECHECK_K51_4
RETURN 1

@M_KOJO_EGG_MESSAGE_COUNTER_K51_4
IF RAND:4
	CALL M_KOJO_EGG_MESSAGE_COM_K51_300(1) ;Chance to redirect into Conversation.
	RETURN 1
ELSEIF TALENT:51:恋人 || TALENT:51:愛欲
	PRINTFORMDL 니토리에게서 기분 좋은 향이 난다...
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"좋은 냄새 안 나? 헤에. :이건 어때? 저렴한 재료로 합성해 봤어. :이거 좋아해?」\n「헤에, 기쁘네... 보통은 내 취향은 아니거든. :무슨 생각 하고 있어? 헤에. :음? 뭐 보고 있는 거야, %K51_EGG_MASTER()%?")%」
ELSE
	PRINTFORMDL 니토리에게서 기분 좋은 향이 난다...
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Huh? I don't smell like %SPLIT_G(@"seaweed:oil:swamp water")%?」\n「...%SPLIT_G(@"Don't say things like that.:Yeah, what of it?:I don't always smell like that...:Is that a bad thing?")%:Heh... Something wrong, %K51_EGG_MASTER()%?:Th-That's just... you know, I wear this sometimes... Why are you looking at me like that?")%」
	SIF !RAND:3
		PRINTFORMDL 그녀의 뺨이 살짝 붉어진다...
ENDIF
WAIT
RETURN 1
